{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18394","headline":"赋得风动万年枝 · 许稷","name":"赋得风动万年枝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"琼树偏春早，光飞处处宜。\n晓浮三殿日，暗度万年枝。\n婀娜摇仙禁，缤翻映玉池。\n含芳烟乍和，拂砌影初移。\n爲近韶阳煦，皆先衆卉垂。\n成阴知可待，不与衆芳随。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许稷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18394.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18394","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}